+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/scope_leak_tests.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/spans_tests.rs` as an integration compile fix for the existing `verification::spans_tests` module declaration.
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/mod.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/existence.rs`
