+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/tests.rs`
+- Modified direct `Memory` constructors to include `scope_organization_id` where required by the expanded legacy memory model.
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/kinds.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/mod.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`
+- Modified `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-graph-schema.md`
